      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "You can schedule a professional inspection through local providers like Olympus Roofing (call 801-274-5800) or request a check via Encore Roofing to assess and document storm-related shingle or structural issues.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "Olympus Roofing (call 801-274-5800)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Utah's spring storms bring heavy winds, hail, and melting snow loads that frequently test the integrity of residential roofs. Knowing how to spot damage safely helps prevent minor bruises from turning into major interior leaks."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Signs of Storm and Hail Damage"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Granule Loss: Finding a heavy buildup of dark, sand-like granules in your gutters means your asphalt shingles are shedding their protective UV coating."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Bruised or Cracked Shingles: Hail impacts leave circular, dark spots where granules are knocked loose, making the shingle soft to the touch."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Dented Metals: Check your metal roof vents, flashing, valleys, and gutters for visible dings as a reliable indicator of severe hail strike zones."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Missing Pieces: High wind gusts can lift, crack, or entirely rip away tabs, leaving the underlayment exposed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Immediate Next Steps"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Stay Off the Roof: Avoid climbing up yourself after a severe weather event, as wet or damaged surfaces are slick and unstable."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Document From the Ground: Use binoculars or take photos from the yard of any fallen tree debris, dented siding, or missing shingle tabs."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Beware Chasing Contractors: Verify that any inspecting contractor carries active Utah licensing and insurance rather than just following local storm cells."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, let me know:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What specific signs or leaks you are noticing?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Your general area in Utah?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can provide more localized contractor recommendations or tips for navigating an insurance claim."
      }
    ],
